[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 18432.31, "timestamp": "05:07:12", "text": "哪兒？我沒有食物。我用轉盤。找點吃的。哦，天哪。是啊"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 18448.628, "timestamp": "05:07:28", "text": "。我們出生點也太好了。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 18452.04, "timestamp": "05:07:32", "text": "好了，我去弄點怪物肉。之後我們還需要很多怪物肉來做東西。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 18458.07, "timestamp": "05:07:38", "text": "哦，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 18460.23, "timestamp": "05:07:40", "text": "好的。 ，這樣"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 18467.19, "timestamp": "05:07:47", "text": "我就可以……撿起來"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 18471.67, "timestamp": "05:07:51", "text": "。我了。點什麼，如果你"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 18473.03, "timestamp": "05:07:53", "text": "想讓我治療你，因為我的魂用完了。 。不小心吃了。 哦，不。蛛"}]